      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Replacing Hf with lighter Ti reduces the alloy's average atomic mass.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional Ti can maintain the BCC structure and solid-solution strengthening after partial Hf removal.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At high temperature, deformation is mainly controlled by dislocations, whose morphology and density control mechanical properties.",
