      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A controlled comparison will use identically cast equiatomic HfMoTaTiZr and Hf0.5MoTaTi1.5Zr specimens, with density, phase, yield strength, and ductility measured at room temperature and approximately 1000 °C.",
